    {
      "id": "engine-matches-formal-semantics",
      "kind": "invariant",
      "statement": "The Rust engine and the Lean formal semantics give identical traces on every golden and on every input of a recorded seeded run of the input generator, whose coverage of the language's constructs is stated.",
      "rationale": "Supported by tests/core/formal-semantics.test.js (WG-4685): the Lean executable reproduces every golden trace, and the native Rust engine and the Lean executable give identical traces on every golden input and on 150 inputs of seed 4685 of tools/gen-engine-inputs.js, whose construct coverage the test checks and tools/differential.js reports. It is evidence on the inputs run, not a proof that the engine refines the semantics.",
