      "kind": "invariant",
      "statement": "The producers record the events of this specification where its event descriptions say: the development server returns, for each request that carries a request id, its own events (workspace events and the answer) stamped with that id in the order it produced them, and infers an external edit (marked inferred) for a change notice whose hash it did not write; the engine runner records each message to and from the worker; texts are named by the same sha-256 the workspace computes.",
